msgid ""
"The index name, the column names and the order of the columns of every table are public. A minor "
"release may append columns at the end of a table, but renames, reorders or removes a column only "
"after a deprecation, so select columns by name rather than by position. The ``attrs`` of "
":func:`~kivi.selection.logistic_regression` are set on the returned frame, and pandas drops them "
"in many operations."
msgstr ""
"每个表格的索引名称、列名及列的顺序都是公共的。次版本可以在表格末尾追加列，但只有经过弃用才会重命名、重排或移除某列，因此请按名称而不是按位置选取列。 "
":func:`~kivi.selection.logistic_regression` 的 ``attrs`` 设置在返回的数据框上，pandas 在许多操作中会丢弃它们。"

